==French==

===Pronunciation===
*{{IPA|/tu.ʃe/}}, {{SAMPA|/tu.Se/}}

===Etumology===
from Germanic [[tukkar]]

===Noun===
{{fr-noun|m}}

# the act of [[touching]] (''cfr. infra'')
# a way of touching
# the [[sensorial function]] [[touch]]

===Verb===
'''toucher'''

# (''transitive'') To [[touch]] physically.
#:''me '''touches''' pas!''
#::''Don't touch me!''
# (''transitive'') To [[move]] emotionally
# (''transitive'') To [[try out]].
#:Je n'ai jamais '''touché''' le tabac''
#::''I've never tried tobacco''

===Conjugation===
{{fr-conj-er|touch|avoir}}

===Derived terms===
* (Dutch) [[toucheren]]

